OL,3,GNEWSAFrom Russian cages to Irish
OL,4,Asanctuary: The five-year rescue journey
OL,5,Aof Bu and Tyapa
OL,6,
OL,7,FAfter years in cramped cages, two brown
OL,8,Fbears are adjusting to their new life
OL,9,Ffollowing a remarkable rescue mission
OL,10,Fthat spanned multiple countries, was
OL,11,Fdisrupted by two major conflicts and
OL,12,Finvolved more than 100 people.
OL,14,FFor Bu and Tyapa, the five-year rescue
OL,15,Fjourney from the Republic of Dagestan
OL,16,Fin Russia to the Irish countryside was
OL,17,Fanything but straightforward.
OL,19,FOne bear had spent their life forced to
OL,20,Fperform in a circus, while the other
OL,21,Fwas confined to a cage so small they
OL,22,Fcould not stand upright.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
