OL,3,GNEWSAFrom Russian cages to Irish
OL,4,Asanctuary: The five-year rescue journey
OL,5,Aof Bu and Tyapa
OL,6,
OL,7,FToday, the bears are now adjusting to a
OL,8,Ftotally different world among the trees
OL,9,Fand grass at Wild Ireland, a sanctuary
OL,10,Ffor rescued animals in County Donegal.
